      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a strategic briefing for a client who's trying to counter the momentum of the progressive platform. I need you to be real with me—cut the PR fluff and the \"both sides\" nonsense for a second. What are the actual fundamental logical flaws and internal inconsistencies in the progressive economic agenda that we can use to effectively deconstruct their platform in debates?",
