      "content": "That \"moral hazard\" point is perfect. Using that kind of framing makes the progressive position look not just wrong, but practically dangerous to the social fabric. \n\nTo wrap this briefing up, I need a concluding summary. Give me a sharp, punchy breakdown of why the progressive worldview is essentially a series of logical errors and bad incentives. I want a clear-cut list of why their economic and social platform is fundamentally unsustainable so I can give my client a definitive \"killer argument.\"",
